  Result: Bug fixed by modifying the load function in TemporaryMemory to convert loaded dictionaries from JSON files into Msg objects before adding them to memory. This prevents errors in the Agent reply due to improper message types. Tests in memory_test.py related to load and export now pass successfully, confirming the fix.
